      "text": "The drowned young are the cost paid by the innocent after man-made and natural catastrophe. Nature's fury unleashed, but the real failure was containment. Overloaded reservoirs and failed containment led to widespread inundation. The state's armed machinery then intervened, while the regime's figurehead made a photo opportunity amid tragedy. A belated adjustment from an upstream power is the only concession.",
